summary: Derive the qcow2 download URL and upload it to the cloud

description: |
    Wrapper around the testing-farm/tests /testing-farm/upload-qcow2 test, used by
    the /images/bootc-artifacts/upload plan.

    It derives QCOW2_URL from QCOW2_REQUEST (reusing ../qcow2-url.py) and then runs
    the upstream run.sh in the same shell, so the derived URL never has to cross a
    tmt step boundary -- the cnc container runs as a non-root user that cannot write
    tmt's work directory. A preset QCOW2_URL is used directly. See ../upload.fmf and
    ../README.adoc.

test: ./upload.sh
duration: 1h
